{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":36,"alongside":59,"kin":84,"engines":109,"usedOn":118,"sites":119,"crewed":120,"museums":121,"hero":127},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/saturn-ib.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":24,"specs":31,"tagline":13,"dispatch":34,"description":35},"saturn-ib","Saturn IB","launcher","NASA","USA","Chrysler / Douglas / IBM","1966","RETIRED","1957-1969","space-race","搭载Apollo 7、Skylab宇航员和ASTP","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Saturn IB — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saturn_IB","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Apollo 7 — NASA NSSDCA","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1968-089A","deep",[25,26,27,28,29,30],"apollo-1","apollo7","skylab-2","skylab-3","skylab-4","apollo-soyuz",{"height_m":32,"diameter_m":33},68.1,6.53,"并非每项 Apollo 任务都需要登月火箭。Saturn IB 是务实之选——一款专为留在地球轨道的任务而设计、达到载人标准的运载火箭：Apollo 7 对重新设计的航天器进行验证飞行，往返 Skylab 的接送飞行，以及 Apollo-Soyuz 的轨道握手。它的第一级众所周知是把早期 Redstone 和 Jupiter 导弹的贮箱捆在一起——用经过验证的部件承担新任务，而不是从零开始的设计。它是这项计划中最不起眼的火箭，也是一堂关于不要过度设计的朴素课程：让机器与任务相匹配。","Saturn IB 是由 Chrysler / Douglas / IBM 在美国建造的轨道运载火箭。发射了 Apollo 7、Skylab 乘组和 ASTP。",[37,41,45,49,52,55],{"id":25,"name":38,"first":39,"year":40},"Apollo 1 (AS-204)","1967-01-27 致命的发射前发射台火灾导致格里森 + 怀特 + 查菲遇难",1967,{"id":26,"name":42,"first":43,"year":44},"Apollo 7","首次载人Apollo飞行——地球轨道上的CSM试飞验证",1968,{"id":27,"name":46,"first":47,"year":48},"Skylab 2","Skylab首次载人访问——修复了受损的工作舱并拯救了整个计划",1973,{"id":28,"name":50,"first":51,"year":48},"Skylab 3","Skylab 第二批乘组——59天，部署双杆式遮阳罩以取代遮阳伞",{"id":29,"name":53,"first":54,"year":48},"Skylab 4","最长Skylab驻留——84天，观测柯侯德彗星，有争议的“Skylab罢工”休息日",{"id":30,"name":56,"first":57,"year":58},"Apollo-Soyuz测试计划（ASTP）","首次国际载人航天合作；首次美苏航天器交会对接",1975,[60,64,68,72,76,80],{"id":61,"name":62,"tagline":63},"apollo-csm-block-i","Apollo CSM (Block I)","最初的Apollo CSM设计——从未载人飞行；1967年1月27日在发射台上致使Apollo 1机组遇难。重新设计后的Block II于1968-1975年间飞行",{"id":65,"name":66,"tagline":67},"lc-34","34号发射台","NASA卡纳维拉尔角发射台（1961-68年）——首枚Saturn I；Apollo 1火灾现场（1967-01-27）；Apollo 7首次载人发射（1968-10-11）",{"id":69,"name":70,"tagline":71},"apollo-csm-block-ii","Apollo CSM Block II","具备登月能力的指挥舱+服务舱",{"id":73,"name":74,"tagline":75},"skylab","Skylab","美国第一个空间站",{"id":77,"name":78,"tagline":79},"lc-39b","39B号发射台","Apollo 10 + Skylab + 53次航天飞机飞行；现为NASA的SLS / Artemis发射台",{"id":81,"name":82,"tagline":83},"soyuz-7k-ok","Soyuz 7K-OK","第一代Soyuz；科马罗夫的致命飞行",[85,89,93,97,101,105],{"id":86,"name":87,"tagline":88},"saturn-v","Saturn V","将人类送上了月球",{"id":90,"name":91,"tagline":92},"titan-ii-glv","Titan II GLV","Project Gemini的工作马队",{"id":94,"name":95,"tagline":96},"atlas-lv-3b","Atlas LV-3B","将水星计划宇航员送入轨道",{"id":98,"name":99,"tagline":100},"mercury-redstone","Mercury-Redstone","首个美国载人火箭 — 陆军Redstone中程弹道导弹的改进型。发射了Freedom 7（1961-05-05）和Liberty Bell 7（1961-07-21）",{"id":102,"name":103,"tagline":104},"atlas-slv-3d","Atlas SLV-3D Centaur","1970年代NASA外行星探测主力——Pioneer 10/11、Helios 1/2、Mariner 9/10、Pioneer Venus",{"id":106,"name":107,"tagline":108},"space-shuttle-stack","Space Shuttle堆栈","轨道器+ET+SRB;135次飞行任务",[110,114],{"id":111,"name":112,"tagline":113},"j-2","J-2","将Apollo送上月球两次的引擎",{"id":115,"name":116,"tagline":117},"h-1","H-1","八台发动机，八次任务——Saturn I的主力发动机",[],[],[],[122],{"id":123,"name":124,"city":125,"item":126},"kennedy-space-center-visitor-complex","Kennedy Space Center Visitor Complex","梅里特岛，佛罗里达州","Saturn IB SA-209，从未飞行的Skylab救援和Apollo－Soyuz 备份火箭","/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/saturn-ib/02.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
